  "design": {
    "idea": "Counterweight Shaft: clear two Gull Thieves and an Anchor Drowned around a giant brass Scale, push the counterweight crate onto the west pan to hoist the mechanism, and bank a blue bolt through the Sea-Glass slit to latch the brake switch opening the upper Rotunda (r5) while revealing a drop chute back to r12.",
